# Placeholder for the ACME LC-500 3D model.
#
# This file is a stub. The real artifact will be a glTF 2.0 binary (.glb)
# produced from a CAD/Blender export of the LC-500 load cell. Phase 5 of
# the SST migration introduces the glTF loader; until then the runtime
# uses procedural geometry as a fallback.
#
# The model SHOULD contain named nodes matching the kind's bench.yaml
# scene_3d.deformations:
#   - a node whose name contains "cell"   (the elastic element — squashes with strain)
#   - a node whose name contains "weight" (the calibration mass — visible when loaded)
#   - a node whose name contains "base"   (the platform — static)
#
# Format: glTF 2.0 binary container (.glb)
# Source: ACME CAD (TBD)
# Pipeline: Blender → glTF export → .glb
